{
  "name": "haodai.daily.wrapup",
  "active": false,
  "versionId": "haodai-v2-foundation-daily-wrapup-1",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Every 15 minutes: build deterministic daily summary via internal API and push once per user/day. No AI Agent."
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "Asia/Taipei"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## haodai.daily.wrapup\n\n**Status:** inactive by default\n\n**Purpose:** Evening wrap-up for users whose `daily_summary_time` is due.\n\n### Env vars\n- `ASSISTANT_API_BASE_URL`\n- `N8N_CALLBACK_TOKEN`\n\n### Input\nSchedule tick\n\n### Output\n`{ user_id, status, should_push }`\n\n### Rules\n- Asia/Taipei\n- Once per user per day (idempotency in API)\n- Deterministic text, no LLM required\n- Empty days may skip push",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "note-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-15m",
      "name": "Every 15 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{($env.ASSISTANT_API_BASE_URL || 'http://placeholder.local:8787') + '/v1/internal/users/summary-due?timezone=Asia/Taipei'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-token",
              "value": "={{$env.N8N_CALLBACK_TOKEN || 'replace_with_local_n8n_token'}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-users-due",
      "name": "Users Summary Due",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [260, 200],
      "notes": "Expected output: { users: [{ user_id, timezone }] }"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "users",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "split-users",
      "name": "Loop Users",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [520, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{($env.ASSISTANT_API_BASE_URL || 'http://placeholder.local:8787') + '/v1/internal/summary/daily'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-token",
              "value": "={{$env.N8N_CALLBACK_TOKEN || 'replace_with_local_n8n_token'}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "content-type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"user_id\": \"{{$json.user_id}}\",\n  \"timezone\": \"{{$json.timezone || 'Asia/Taipei'}}\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"summary:{{$json.user_id}}:{{$now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd')}}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-build-summary",
      "name": "Build Daily Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [780, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "should-push",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.should_push}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-should-push",
      "name": "Should Push?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1040, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{($env.ASSISTANT_API_BASE_URL || 'http://placeholder.local:8787') + '/v1/internal/line/push'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-token",
              "value": "={{$env.N8N_CALLBACK_TOKEN || 'replace_with_local_n8n_token'}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "content-type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"to_user_id\": \"{{$json.user_id}}\",\n  \"messages\": [{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": {{JSON.stringify($json.message_text)}} }],\n  \"delivery_key\": \"summary-push:{{$json.user_id}}:{{$json.date}}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-push-summary",
      "name": "Push Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1300, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "status",
              "value": "skipped_no_push"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "skip-push",
      "name": "Skip Push",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1300, 320]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 15 Minutes": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Users Summary Due", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Users Summary Due": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Loop Users", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Loop Users": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Build Daily Summary", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Build Daily Summary": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Should Push?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Should Push?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Push Summary", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Skip Push", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}
